    "description": "Started Victoreen as an Technician responsible for the Diagnostic Imaging product line calibration and customer support.  During my time I developed a new calibration system for the entire product line. Due to the much tighter specs of this system the company was able to market the product with better specifications.\n\nI soon was promoted to Software Engineer when I developed a new Excel Add-in that controlled the instruments and automatically entered data into the worksheets.  The Excel-Add is so successful that competitors began creating there own Add-ins and are still in use today.",
